From: goodluckOS <local>
Subject: [PATCH] net: rt2800usb: add ZTopInc 350b:9101 (RT3070-class)
Date: Fri, 06 Nov 2026 21:00:00 +0000

USB Wi-Fi dongle 350b:9101 is RT3070-class (vendor-specific),
needs explicit device ID to match rt2800usb driver.
---
 drivers/net/wireless/ralink/rt2x00/rt2800usb.c | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/net/wireless/ralink/rt2x00/rt2800usb.c b/drivers/net/wireless/ralink/rt2x00/rt2800usb.c
index 0000000..1111111 100644
--- a/drivers/net/wireless/ralink/rt2x00/rt2800usb.c
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/ralink/rt2x00/rt2800usb.c
@@ -810,4 +810,6 @@ static const struct usb_device_id rt2800usb_device_table[] = {
 	/* Askey */
 	{ USB_DEVICE(0x1690, 0x0740) },
+	/* ZTopInc */
+	{ USB_DEVICE(0x350b, 0x9101) },
 	/* ASUS */
 	{ USB_DEVICE(0x0b05, 0x1731) },
